# ============================================================================
#  ab_tester.ancl  -  ANCL Native Allen Bradley EtherNet/IP CIP Client Tester
#

#  A native Win32 dark-themed Allen Bradley client, written in ANCL.
#  NexusEdge themed with GlowButtons, live polling ListView tag grid, read/write.
#  100% CRT-free PE32+, GUI subsystem.
# ============================================================================

